        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n2\n00\n10\n3\n010\n000\n4\n0011\n0100",
        "output": "NO\nYES\nYES",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: It can be proven that we can not make AAA equal to BBB by using the given operation.\nTest case 222: We can apply the following operations: 010‾→011‾→0000\\underline{10} \\rightarrow 0\\underline{11} \\rightarrow 000010​→011​→000.\nTest case 333: We can apply the following operations: 001‾1→0111‾→01000\\underline{01}1 \\rightarrow 01\\underline{11} \\rightarrow 0100001​1→0111​→0100."
